setFeedRoute.t.sol
├── when caller is not the module's safe
│  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
└── when caller is the module's safe
   ├── when the first price feed is zero
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidFeedRoute
   └── when the first price feed is not zero
      ├── given the token decimals are unavailable, below minimum or above maximum
      │  └── it should revert with InvalidDecimals
      └── given the token decimals are within the allowed range
         ├── it should associate the provided feed route to the provided token in contract storage
         ├── it should associate the provided feeds to their respective staleness thresholds in contract storage
         └── it should emit a FeedRouteRegistered event
